## OSRS Workflow Protocol

### Snapshot Loop

1. Fetch player payload from hiscore API
2. Normalize and resolve mode metadata
3. Persist snapshot to `data/snapshots/<player>/<timestamp>.json`
4. Compute delta against prior snapshot when available
5. Emit Scribe logs with timing/result metadata

### Report Loop

1. Build report from snapshot payload and delta
2. Persist markdown to `reports/<player>/<snapshot_id>.md`
3. Log generation metadata with Scribe

